# Il Mheg Pixie: "Flying. Whenever this creature attacks, surveil 1." Bot1 pays {1}{U} with Mox Sapphire and Mox Ruby on turn 1. On turn 3,
# after drawing Mountain, it attacks; the trigger looks at exactly one card, the Swamp on top, and Bot1 puts it into the graveyard (CR 701.25a)
# while the Plains under it stays in the library. The Pixie flies, and Bot2, with no flyer, takes its 2 damage.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Il Mheg Pixie
Island x4
Mountain
Swamp
Plains x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Il Mheg Pixie.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Il Mheg Pixie > Bot2)
Bot1.Arrange(| Swamp)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Graveyard = Swamp
? Bot1.Battlefield.Il Mheg Pixie.Keywords = Flying

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Swamp
Bot1.Library.Count = 12
Bot2.Life = 18
